een Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Letting go of guilt and shame; God's voice of victory silences the accuser.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E73"},{"s":1795317959,"e":1795319850,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"To be great in God's kingdom, you are to serve one another on a daily basis.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S03E23"},{"s":1795319850,"e":1795321713,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"To fulfill your destiny, let go of negativity. God knows how to redeem everything you've been through!","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S11E32"},{"s":1795321713,"e":1795323551,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"It's easy to feel lacking, but God gave everyone the right personality and talent to reach destiny.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E37"},{"s":1795323551,"e":1795325387,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Joel says that it takes faith to praise God in the good times and the tough times.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E164"},{"s":1795325387,"e":1795327277,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"To experience breakthroughs, one adopts a quick mentality; God can shift things in a person's favor.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E136"},{"s":1795327277,"e":1795329110,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Prayers and faith set miracles into motion, God is always at work behind the scenes.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E267"},{"s":1795329110,"e":1795331014,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"A person's life is full of voices trying to define them, but they are who God says they are.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E281"},{"s":1795331014,"e":1795332898,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Joel Osteen teaches how to eliminate negative thoughts and replace them with positivity.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2025E22"},{"s":1795332898,"e":1795334757,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Pruning is essential for growth; trusting God during these times.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E214"},{"s":1795334757,"e":1795336637,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Appreciate your gifts and talents. Use them well, and God's anointing will take you further than you imagine!","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S04E08"},{"s":1795336637,"e":1795338500,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"When life dosen't make sense, and it's hard to believe. Remember God's plans are bigger than our understanding","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S16E12"},{"s":1795338500,"e":1795340337,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Don't let life's ups and downs disturb your joy. Jesus said, 'Stop allowing yourself to be upset.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S06E28"},{"s":1795340337,"e":1795342225,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God equips people with the strength to overcome any obstacle; challenges don't defeat people.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E135"},{"s":1795342225,"e":1795344079,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Under pressure, focus on the right thinking; dismissing negativity and remembering God's promises.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E263"},{"s":1795344079,"e":1795345925,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Don't let doubt limit God's plans for you. You may not see the answer, but He has the final say!","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S06E16"},{"s":1795345925,"e":1795347790,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Joel talks about how to see upstream blessings, people need downstream faith.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E322"},{"s":1795347790,"e":1795349680,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Joel talks about how God's promises of healing and freedom are for people.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E231"},{"s":1795349680,"e":1795351572,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God will settle people accounts.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E81"},{"s":1795351572,"e":1795353440,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"As believers we can't let outside circumstances determine our joy. God's promises should fuel our joy.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S16E37"},{"s":1795353440,"e":1795355319,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Joel gives everyone the faith tools to move onto the next chapter of life.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E06"},{"s":1795355319,"e":1795357171,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"People face situations they don't understand, but God has prepared the solution.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E21"},{"s":1795357171,"e":1795357200,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"To live as a mature believer, we must surrender our will to what God has planned for our lives.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2026E02"},{"s":1795357200,"e":1795371600,"t":"Lakewood Live with Joel and Victoria","d":"Join Joel and Victoria for live Sunday worship.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/48d0aeb5503f15876ccd8ac2898f8131/rokuFeed/assets/db5c0b277808545e9bf0bebf8a85273a.png"},{"s":1795357200,"e":1795371600,"t":"Lakewoo