iced Himself to give us everything.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2025E39"},{"s":1795383439,"e":1795385296,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God knew you before your birth and has planned your days. He created you for more than ordinary.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S08E21"},{"s":1795385296,"e":1795387182,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"When one feels weighed down, God promises unexpected sunshine; joy comes in the morning.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E149"},{"s":1795387182,"e":1795389075,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"People either settle or do the right thing; that discomfort is a sign that God is calling.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E282"},{"s":1795389075,"e":1795390935,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Remembering trouble is temporary; God uses it to position people for new levels of favor.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E47"},{"s":1795390935,"e":1795392815,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God's dream for your life is bigger than your own. One touch of his favor can catapult you ahead.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2025E01"},{"s":1795392815,"e":1795398838,"t":"Full Service: It Changed Positions","d":"Joel Osteen explains how to turn hurts, betrayals and disappointments into a footstool beneath your feet.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/32256a64f4fb7332f2baea892c16975f/rokuFeed/assets/ccf65f40bdfa50e992bde3820bea9d9e.png"},{"s":1795398838,"e":1795400741,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"No one can become who they were created to be without the hard times.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2025E16"},{"s":1795400741,"e":1795402612,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God has moments prepared for a quick work in life; staying encouraged; a breakthrough is coming.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E54"},{"s":1795402612,"e":1795404470,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God's dream for life is much bigger than human's own; he's going to take everyone far.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2025E53"},{"s":1795404470,"e":1795410195,"t":"Full Service: The Strength of Silence","d":"Joel Osteen explains why holding your tongue can protect your peace, your relationships and your honor.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/33ca8e1e947879cfa8245360799430d9/rokuFeed/assets/e9247cf8268355af8cbac013e74b7bbf.jpg"},{"s":1795410195,"e":1795412053,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Learning to handle difficulties and find peace within.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E23"},{"s":1795412053,"e":1795413943,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"If you keep focused on the past, you will miss out on the future God has for you. You must let it go.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S03E21"},{"s":1795413943,"e":1795415791,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God counts on people to impact others; one should use their experiences to heal those around them.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E199"},{"s":1795415791,"e":1795417676,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"A second touch from God is coming, which renews one's passion and fulfills one's destiny.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E62"},{"s":1795417676,"e":1795419519,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"As believers we are carriers of honor. When we show honor there is a commanded blessing released to our lives.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S01E03"},{"s":1795419519,"e":1795421420,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Before a promise is fulfilled, we may face silence; trusting that God is working behind the scenes.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E43"},{"s":1795421420,"e":1795423273,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Stay in faith; His promises will come.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E19"},{"s":1795423273,"e":1795425159,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God is working behind the scenes for you. Trust His timing, even amid setbacks!","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S05E33"},{"s":1795425159,"e":1795427050,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God's grace helps people finish what He starts.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E134"},{"s":1795427050,"e":1795428911,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Even when people see no change, God is working behind the scenes.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E193"},{"s":1795428911,"e":1795430793,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Don't let life's circumstances steal your peace. Guard your energy, and God will fight your battles!","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S06E08"},{"s":1795430793,"e":1795432651,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Feeling discouraged? God is working behind the scenes. Don't give up; your future is being prepared!","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S06E31"},{"s":1795432651,"e":1795434526,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God's blessings line up a person's future, his favors are unstoppable.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E01"},{"s":1795434526,"e":1795436383,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Ephesians 1:5 says God adopted us into His family. Because of this, you'll receive blessings and favor.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S08E02"},{"s":1795436383,"e":1795438256,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Honoring those around oneself sows seeds of blessing for their future.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E334"},{"s":1795438256,"e":1795440152,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"To experience new favor, showing God one can handle the blessings.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E55"},{"s":1795440152,"e":1795442070,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Victory, healing and abundance.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E08"},{"s":1795442070,"e":1795443931,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Faith doesn't exempt people from difficulties; God's strength equips people.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E82"},{"s":1795443931,"e":1795445820,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"We all deal with negative thoughts everyday. God instructs us to renew and align our thoughts to His word.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S02E02"},{"s":1795445820,"e":1795447723,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Greatness comes from the Heavenly Father, who brings out the gifts and talents within everyone.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E109"},{"s":1795447723,"e":1795449613,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"What seems big can be defeated; God's resurrection power within people makes them powerful enough.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E325"},{"s":1795449613,"e":1795451472,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Setbacks are setups for advantage.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E13"},{"s":1795451472,"e":1795453328,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God gave of Himself generously and desires that we would follow His example.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2025E58"},{"s":1795453328,"e":1795455236,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"To see God's promise fulfilled, one may need to go from \"believing\" to \"still believing.\"","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E94"},{"s":1795455236,"e":1795457114,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Learning to find balance between striving for personal growth and recognizing divine support.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E304"},{"s":1795455236,"e":1795457114,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Learning to find balance between striving for personal growth and recognizing divine support.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E304"},{"s":1795457114,"e":1795459004,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God has given us the great ability to believe. When we get in agreement with God is greatness is activated.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S01E05"},{"s":1795459004,"e":1795460828,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"In tough seasons, remembering that God is at work; he'll give people strength to keep going.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E200"},{"s":1795460828,"e":1795462689,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"No injustice or disappointment can stop destiny; embracing an incredible future.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E342"},{"s":1795462689,"e":1795464580,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"We all face obstacles in life. We can react negatively and complain and doubt or switch over to praise.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S01E12"},{"s":1795464580,"e":1795466434,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Unseen prayers strengthen us in need. Your prayers can make a difference in others' lives too!","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S07E16"},{"s":1795466434,"e":1795468308,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Divine help is always near, ready to bring hope and transformation in challenging times.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E288"},{"s":1795468308,"e":1795470209,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"To live joyfully, one should enjoy their current place in life while they await God's new gifts.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E306"},{"s":1795470209,"e":1795472100,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Joel tells patience is a key God uses to develop maturity.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E32"},{"s":1795472100,"e":1795474007,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God desires healing; receiving His healing.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E68"},{"s":1795474007,"e":1795475891,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God is always speaking, the question is, whether people are listening.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E330"},{"s":1795475891,"e":1795477779,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"We all face disqualifying seasons. Stir your faith; God sees you and is working to bring you out stronger!","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S09E08"},{"s":1795477779,"e":1795479658,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Mistakes don't disqualify you from God's purpose. Turn to Him, and He'll take you from glory to glory!","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S05E22"},{"s":1795479658,"e":1795481543,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Often we see struggles or habits as permanent. As believers If we allow God to renew our mind, we can overcome","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S03E25"},{"s":1795481543,"e":1795483441,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God places promptings in people's hearts to guide them; God's voice leads people on the best path.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E209"},{"s":1795483441,"e":1795485318,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God specializes in defying the odds; what looks impossible for people is possible with God.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2025E06"},{"s":1795485318,"e":1795487194,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Inviting people to believe in God and never settle for less.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E28"},{"s":1795487194,"e":1795489072,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"We should always be on the look out for way to be a blessing to other people. Always looking to give not get.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S03E03"},{"s":1795489072,"e":1795490953,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"It may feel like you've lost time, but God knows how to restore you and make up for what you lost.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S10E26"},{"s":1795490953,"e":1795492811,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Step out in faith, not fear. Let go and embrace the new with God's peace guiding you!","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S06E30"},{"s":1795492811,"e":1795494696,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"There will always be people who try to squeeze you into their mold. But God created you to run your own race.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S02E10"},{"s":1795494696,"e":1795496553,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"No mistake can cancel God's plan; His love is unconditional.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E17"},{"s":1795496553,"e":1795498469,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"People don't have to make everything happen alone; trust God, he will open the right doors in life.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E143"},{"s":1795498469,"e":1795500369,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Joel on how every difficulty is a setup for God to do something new; God uses it to one's advantage.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E261"},{"s":1795500369,"e":1795502247,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Rejecting negative thoughts and embracing a disciplined, positive mindset rooted in faith.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E239"},{"s":1795502247,"e":1795504121,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"One's environment doesn't define them; everyone is a child of God crowned with His favor.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E308"},{"s":1795504121,"e":1795505955,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Joel says that even in unfair situations, people can trust God to work out His plan.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E163"},{"s":1795505955,"e":1795507853,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Expecting God's favor with a faith-filled attitude allows him to do incredible things.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E244"},{"s":1795507853,"e":1795509714,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"People should surround themselves with people who call them higher.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E198"},{"s":1795509714,"e":1795511614,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Joel Osteen encourages embracing challenges, as they often lead to unexpected breakthroughs.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2025E23"},{"s":1795511614,"e":1795513492,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God promotes people who use their talents to help others rise.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E126"},{"s":1795513492,"e":1795515384,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"When God gives a promise, waiting may be needed; He wants to show out in one's life.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E227"},{"s":1795515384,"e":1795517288,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God is on the throne; He said weeping may endure for a night, but joy is coming in the morning.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2025E04"},{"s":1795517288,"e":1795519182,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"The God's life transformation plans.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E35"},{"s":1795519182,"e":1795521063,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Powerful things happen when people find others who agree with God's promises.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E99"},{"s":1795521063,"e":1795522959,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God gives people everything they need to reach their destiny.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2025E18"},{"s":1795522959,"e":1795524816,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Choosing humility and vulnerability.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E16"},{"s":1795524816,"e":1795526701,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"Everyone is worthy of love and blessings. Recognize your unique purpose in God's plan.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S14E14"},{"s":1795526701,"e":1795528560,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God molds people; one must accept themselves as he changes them; it's key to rise higher.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E286"},{"s":1795528560,"e":1795530458,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God is going before believers to arrange things in their favor, making what they can't achieve.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E89"},{"s":1795530458,"e":1795532313,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"People don't have to live ashamed of what they have been through; redeeming every past hurt.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E212"},{"s":1795532313,"e":1795534136,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God's favor brings prosperity even in hard times. The greatest force breathes in your direction!","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S06E03"},{"s":1795534136,"e":1795536035,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"I Am are 2 powerful words; the words that follow I am will come looking for you.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2025E25"},{"s":1795536035,"e":1795537882,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"God wants to bless people so much that they will forget their past pain.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E210"},{"s":1795537882,"e":1795539760,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"We all go through dry seasons; God sees that barren place, and He's coming to do something about it.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2025E41"},{"s":1795539760,"e":1795541652,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"What God has for one's future is greater than one's past; He brings people out better than before.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S2024E127"},{"s":1795541652,"e":1795543543,"t":"Joel Osteen Weekly","st":"Joel Osteen Weekly","d":"As believers when we pray about an Issue, we must release it to be answered how and when God wants to answer.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/b496fbc36b2f1ed8a79f2a85554f6d54/images/gracenote/assets/p27373717_b_h8_ac.jpg","ep":"S02E22"}]